{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6972105e13971664","name":"Bandolier","source":{"id":"source:reference-6972105e13971664","title":"Bandolier","revision":16126,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:20Z","sha256":"fea0baa8cd2513a681c2a2354dd8f7bf67531783c37b02f6a1876e5c1b121cc5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16126","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bandolier&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6972105e13971664","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 100\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since there are so many types of weapons, there are an equally large number of ammunition types. Depending upon the weapon the wearer carries, a Bandolier may contain any number or form of ammunition. A Bandolier has 12 slots that can each hold a single Tiny weapon (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["knife"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knife","referenceId":"reference:846e26d154ced41e"},"), or single piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," weighing up to 0.5 kg. Any item on the Bandolier can be retrieved as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". No items come stocked on a standard Bandolier, as they do with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utility Belt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utility_Belt","referenceId":"reference:65a8c9e6ea86bb1c"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
